            224  * ============================================================
            225  * PRTGD3 - Read GD3 English track name and print it
            226  *
            227  * Reads the 32-bit little-endian GD3 relative offset from the
            228  * VGM header at VGMBASE+>14.  The offset is relative to its own
            229  * location, so:  GD3_abs = VGMBASE + VGM_GD3OFS + offset
            230  * The GD3 header is 12 bytes ("Gd3 " + version + length), after
            231  * which follows the first string: English track name in UTF-16L
            232  * We iterate through the UTF-16LE chars, outputting the low byt
            233  * of each via XOP 12 (TIBUG single character output), stopping 
            234  * low byte is zero.  Falls back to a generic message if no GD3 
            235  *
            236  * Trashes: R0, R6, R7, R9
            237  * Returns: via B *R11
            238  * ============================================================
80FE        239  PRTGD3
            240  * --- Step 1: read GD3 relative offset (32-bit little-endian) -
            241  * VGM stores it LE: byte[>14]=lo8, byte[>15]=hi8 (low 16 bits).
            242  * TMS9900 MOV loads [addr] as high byte, [addr+1] as low byte,
            243  * so after MOV the bytes are swapped; SWPB corrects this.
            244  * Upper 16 bits (bytes >16/>17) ignored; VGM files fit in 64KB.
80FE C1E0   245           MOV  @VGM_GD3ABS,R7           * load LE word (bytes sw
8100 9014 
8102 06C7   246           SWPB R7                       * R7 = correct 16-bit of
            247  
            248  * --- Step 2: check for absent GD3 (offset == 0) ---
8104 0287   249           CI   R7,0
8106 0000 
8108 1321   250           JEQ  NOGD3
            251  
            252  * --- Step 3: compute absolute address of GD3 tag ---
            253  * Absolute = VGMBASE + VGM_GD3OFS + R7
810A 0227   254           AI   R7,VGM_GD3ABS            * R7 -> "Gd3 " magic
810C 9014 
            255  
ASM990 2.4.6                                Sat Aug  8 10:52:39 2026 Page 0006


